{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"1ea66ccaa9f986683657e45d7af5938add42c69e","node_id":"C_kwDOCr1639oAKDFlYTY2Y2NhYTlmOTg2NjgzNjU3ZTQ1ZDdhZjU5MzhhZGQ0MmM2OWU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Itzaprado","email":"132521881+Itzaprado@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-14T18:14:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-14T18:14:31Z"},"message":"fix(api-explorer): resolve extension routes to absolute Looker host URLs (#1735)\n\n### Description\nFixes b/532671853.\nIn Looker Extension mode, right-clicking a link and selecting \"Open link\nin new tab\" resolves the relative URL against the sandboxed iframe\norigin instead of the parent Looker host origin.\n\nThis PR:\n1. Adds a `resolveRouteToAbsoluteUrl` method to environment adaptors\n(`BrowserAdaptor` and `ExtensionAdaptor`).\n2. Updates `ExtensionAdaptor` to construct absolute parent window URLs\nusing `lookerHostData`.\n3. Updates the custom `Link` component to render absolute URLs in `href`\nwhen running in Extension mode, while intercepting normal left-clicks to\nperform internal memory-routing.\n4. Changes documentation references to use the smart `Link` wrapper\ninstead of `react-router-dom`'s default `Link`.","tree":{"sha":"e8f10c5c15fa42e5f556cfbc9e7613f32aead9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/looker-open-source/sdk-codegen/git/trees/e8f10c5c15fa42e5f556cfbc9e7613f32aead9d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/looker-open-source/sdk-codegen/git/commits/1ea66ccaa9f986683657e45d7af5938add42c69e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqf1sHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+4oQAA5fDZ2wUCMu1DSXIxiQJPn1\nhOL5UQ/v8bhlxWq1VUTpPvXpe6rw7efdHvTLZJBKRLD1oJAfUz25qsWWqnFCe5hd\n2pltVpI8fXnIPKevgPH93AgNw4PBt+UeXlzEq7VdcYfxz7NvwJQJWzeMqw4TNsfH\nXjxJFE3Y3dYoR7bcIAytBtQaJfzZw3r5OexQSG1KvZK/iqUys1h6ebzfdkERUYPd\ncdIIKkvVmTqJJJwIdEzdpqtwWUpfGCKPLLIkxW8F8qRaB4nWGDXtqPtuAw4HhW4a\n0QVwAkZq1xaLkTyW/FDfusk3OvNt3LvqOiltx0HgQz+7wFt649Zc73xZSmsvl6OE\nh+TMOwoDV6NJVUB/GUbz4q1N+IIM9oc0hpo4Fn2rsjvigU9YqdOQWkaWBKOzA5z6\n5AvDh+QfUPLaSEgyoX6NuAS1j99vMyI/xJqjjpTbljSQmCx57s/F2zyAmQ3Ub8PB\neYaRV6ceDOn9Jv+iNCxHc8fAF3EQ1nl1cM0J+/IGgWgHxIvO8ff5w1mWrtTKEdPM\npBF7HlGQ6Rshx91kR8I38eFLgQEfGAEzyRGe4o24jQjmEiE1AYPMkJN7WnbRZHFC\nZxxMpLIW4GWRPwZQAIfaADHmrEPVp3au6Ot4f6OcVoNpo0Iz/y7t8/Oc1gFcPywp\nCOqiIuAYT/gGUEuJ7vBS\n=CBFu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e8f10c5c15fa42e5f556cfbc9e7613f32aead9d6\nparent c2bf549bdb6bf02117875712094195a7b48701fb\nauthor Itzaprado <132521881+Itzaprado@users.noreply.github.com> 1786731271 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786731271 -0600\n\nfix(api-explorer): resolve extension routes to absolute Looker host URLs (#1735)\n\n### Description\nFixes b/532671853.\nIn Looker Extension mode, right-clicking a link and selecting \"Open link\nin new tab\" resolves the relative URL against the sandboxed iframe\norigin instead of the parent Looker host origin.\n\nThis PR:\n1. Adds a `resolveRouteToAbsoluteUrl` method to environment adaptors\n(`BrowserAdaptor` and `ExtensionAdaptor`).\n2. Updates `ExtensionAdaptor` to construct absolute parent window URLs\nusing `lookerHostData`.\n3. Updates the custom `Link` component to render absolute URLs in `href`\nwhen running in Extension mode, while intercepting normal left-clicks to\nperform internal memory-routing.\n4. Changes documentation references to use the smart `Link` wrapper\ninstead of `react-router-dom`'s default `Link`.","verified_at":"2026-08-14T18:14:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/looker-open-source/sdk-codegen/commits/1ea66ccaa9f986683657e45d7af5938add42c69e","html_url":"https://github.com/looker-open-source/sdk-codegen/commit/1ea66ccaa9f986683657e45d7af5938add42c69e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/looker-open-source/sdk-codegen/commits/1ea66ccaa9f986683657e45d7af5938add42c69e/comments","author":{"login":"Itzaprado","id":132521881,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-YfmQ","avatar_url":"https://avata